WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
WinGetty: your own winget source, on your network.

00:03.000 --> 00:07.000
The end-user catalog lists every imported app, with one-time source setup and per-app install commands.

00:07.000 --> 00:11.000
Each app shows its versions with Install buttons and copyable winget commands.

00:11.000 --> 00:15.000
Admins manage packages in the WinGetty web interface - or let the importer do it automatically.

00:15.000 --> 00:18.000
Catalog behavior is configurable: enable it, require login, set the source name, toggle install links.

00:18.000 --> 00:21.000
Import. Publish. Install. Free and open source on GitHub.
